WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:03.160
What's up guys!

00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:04.060
We are Pongfinity.

00:00:04.060 --> 00:00:06.680
Today we are attempting the world's fastest table tennis serve.

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:10.820
So there is this
Japanese table tennis player called

00:00:10.830 --> 00:00:11.720
Asuka Sakai

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:13.920
And he is claimed to have the
fastest serve in the world.

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:15.800
It looks something like this.

00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:21.520
Apparently the fastest way to do it
is with only topspin.

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:24.620
You hit it with the backhand side of the racket.

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:26.180
So not forehand.

00:00:26.180 --> 00:00:27.400
You go under.

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:28.740
I don't know why.

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:32.280
I think the reason is that you get
more wrist with the backhand

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:34.460
So it's a faster wrist movement.

00:00:34.460 --> 00:00:37.060
And it's also kind of a disguise

00:00:37.220 --> 00:00:42.320
If the opponent thinks that you are serving with 
the forehand - it suddenly comes with backhand

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:43.620
It can surprise the opponent.

00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:46.660
And I think it's actually easier to do with
the backhand side than the forehand side

00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:48.340
Let's try a few times!

00:00:56.880 --> 00:00:58.400
That would have been fast!

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:02.700
This is really difficult.

00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:04.380
I feel like I'm doing
something wrong.

00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:07.700
Yeah, I think we could take some slow-mo footage 
of the serve currently

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:10.580
and try to see and analyze if there is something that you are doing wrong.

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:12.000
Let's see what I'm doing wrong.

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:13.340
Okay.

00:01:13.340 --> 00:01:14.900
Here comes it has.

00:01:16.460 --> 00:01:19.360
It has to hit the white line to get the fastest possible serve.

00:01:19.360 --> 00:01:22.000
The longest distance between
the two edges.

00:01:26.180 --> 00:01:27.320
Too far out.

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:28.640
Closer to the edge.

00:01:28.640 --> 00:01:31.080
Five centimeters too far.

00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:32.647
Here it comes.

00:01:32.647 --> 00:01:34.060
Good toss.

00:01:34.820 --> 00:01:38.020
I think that was a good touch but it just went a lot over.

00:01:38.020 --> 00:01:39.340
Yeah, it is a bit high.

00:01:39.620 --> 00:01:41.100
High over the net.

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:45.460
I think the racket was too much open.

00:01:45.460 --> 00:01:48.420
The racket should be more closed.

00:01:48.440 --> 00:01:50.620
Otherwise it goes like this. Exactly.

00:01:51.160 --> 00:01:53.240
Maybe I serve it from too high?

00:01:53.240 --> 00:01:55.200
Yeah, maybe I should go lower.

00:01:55.200 --> 00:01:58.040
Because now I hit it down. 
Maybe I should hit it more forward.

00:01:58.120 --> 00:01:59.040
If I am lower.

00:02:03.620 --> 00:02:05.000
Okay new try.

00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:07.000
I'll try it slower first.

00:02:07.580 --> 00:02:08.780
To get the technique.

00:02:17.040 --> 00:02:18.220
That was a bit slow.

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:21.540
That was the best one so far.

00:02:25.440 --> 00:02:26.680
That was quite fast.

00:02:28.680 --> 00:02:30.320
That's the right speed but...

00:02:31.380 --> 00:02:32.780
That was close!

00:02:34.740 --> 00:02:36.340
Yeah, that's the serve!

00:02:37.480 --> 00:02:38.900
That was close!

00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:43.060
That was really fast actually!

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:46.960
That was good.

00:02:46.960 --> 00:02:49.360
I think you have got the touch now!

00:02:49.740 --> 00:02:51.600
Yeah. Clearly!

00:02:51.600 --> 00:02:52.960
It's all about the topspin!

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:54.160
To get the kicker.

00:02:54.180 --> 00:02:57.100
Get good topspin and right on the edge

00:02:57.700 --> 00:02:58.980
Then you get the fastest serve.

00:03:03.520 --> 00:03:05.140
Well, that definitely wasn't easy.

00:03:05.140 --> 00:03:07.799
It was really difficult to be consistent with the serve.

00:03:07.799 --> 00:03:09.420
But I think eventually we got it quite well!

00:03:09.420 --> 00:03:10.100
Yeah

00:03:10.100 --> 00:03:11.980
Anyway, remember to subscribe!

00:03:11.980 --> 00:03:13.620
And check our previous videos there!

00:03:13.620 --> 00:03:14.740
Until next time!

